    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_010_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "5570C1F196759E63",
      "text": "什麼，原來閣下是代替\\n首席冠軍來的啊！沒關係！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
